      "SavedSearchOut": {
        "description": "A saved search as the account page shows it.\n\nThere was a `new_matches: int = 0` here. Nothing ever assigned it and the\nfrontend never read it, so the API advertised a count that was always zero —\nthe schema promising a capability that did not exist. Removed rather than\nimplemented: \"new since you last looked\" needs a decision about what the\nuser has *seen*, which is not the same as what the last digest announced,\nand `alerts_sent` only records the latter.",
        "properties": {
          "cadence": {
            "title": "Cadence",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "filters": {
            "title": "Filters",
            "type": "object"
